  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;be the required radius<br />As origin lies on the circle, the distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>r</mtext></math><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0150_8429f6203c62.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 187px;\" /><br /><br />As the two circles touch externally, distance between centres is sum of the radii<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
